<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>Zoebook Privacy Policy </strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Information We Collect</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Zoebook collects personal information such as email address, name, and other statistics. Also, we strive our best to use information collected in a way that benefits every user. We use the information to better personalize a user interface that displays contents based on user personal preferences.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">One way we collect information from you: When you go to our main page, there is a sign up tab, which allows users to join our platform and provide personal information such as name, email address, and so on in order to navigate through the most available functionalities or features.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Another way we collect information from you: For instance, we track how you use our services and how you navigate through our platform. Also, we study your actions based on videos you watch so that we can continue delivering or recommending additional videos instantaneously to your own profile. And those records help other businesses target their desired market then help them advertise directly to their market segment.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Cookies</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Our partners and we use multiple technologies to effectively collect and store information when you visit our platform by sending out cookies to your devices. Again, we tend to collect data for our partners such as advertising services. However, we will not associate a cookie or anonymous identifier with sensitive categories such as those based on race, religion, sexual orientation or health when showing you suited ads.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Usefulness of Collected information</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">In order to provide you with best and most relevant contents, it is required that we collect information from all of our services. Doing so gives us the ability to display contents that value your time while browsing through our platform. Also, the information we collect from you helps us identify your preferences, which then increases our capability to deliver contents that can satisfy your preferences.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Updating personal information</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">We are very flexible with this process. We allow users to update their information whenever they want. Also, users have the ability to upload a profile picture, which is not required. You have the ability to upload, edit, and delete your content.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">After you delete information from our services, we may not immediately delete residual copies from our active servers and may not remove information from our backup systems because we tend to save your information- just in case you decide to rejoin our platform in the future.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Information we share</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">We respect your personal information; so therefore, sharing your personal information with outsiders (companies, organizations or other institutions) is not in our domain. In other words, we do not share personal information with other businesses outside of Zoebook unless one of the following circumstances occurs:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Consent: We can only share your personal information if you agree to our request or demand. Without your permission, we will not reveal or share your personal information with other businesses.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Legal purposes: We will share personal information with companies, organizations or other institutions outside of Zoebook if we believe that the disclosure of the information is reasonably necessary to meet any applicable law, or any regulation, legal process or enforceable governmental request, and so forth.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Application of this Privacy</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Our Privacy Policy strictly applies to users and business partners that use our services directly within our platform. Anything outside of our platform- even though something may display our business name- does not cover under our policy. In other words- our policy does not cover the information practices of other companies and organizations who advertise our services, and who may use cookies and other technologies to serve and offer relevant ads.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Compliance with regulatory authorities</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">We always strive our best to review our compliance with our Privacy Policy in a regular basis. Also, because we care for our users, we always act quickly and responsively when someone complaints regarding an issue. And, conducting a follow-up to ensure that an issue has been resolved is our motivation to retain customer loyalty. In the event where we&rsquo;re unable to resolve any complaints regarding the transfer of personal information, we plan to work with data protection authorities.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Links</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Our web site contains links to other sites. Please be aware that we are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of such other sites. We encourage our users to be aware when they leave our site and to read the privacy statements of any other site that collects personally identifiable information.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Changes</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Our Privacy Policy is a continuous process that tends to gradually change. We will notify you by email when a change is made. Most importantly, it is a user&rsquo;s responsibility to always read our Privacy Policy before joining the platform. And if you do not like using our services because of our Privacy Policy, feel free to stop using our services.</span></p>
